-cable passthrough, anti-theft zip and water repellent exterior fit up to 17-inch laptop suitable for travel</h2> <div class=\"OverViewBanner__overBannerTextSubDescription__Akro1\"><div><ul> \r\n   <li> \r\n  Aura RGB dynamic illumination with adaptive brightness, plus an internal light strip for easy organization</li> \r\n<li>        Modular front compartment doubles as a messenger bag, with an RFID-blocking pocket to provide additional security on the go</li> \r\n<li>         Pack fast and travel safe with suitcase-style zip, anti-theft zip clip and hidden backrest pocket</li> \r\n<li>       Effortless organization with multiple compartments, including a padded laptop partition, multiple slip and zip pockets and an internal detachable pouch</li> \r\n<li>         Water-repellent and scratch-resistant 1680D exterior plus water-repellent zip and reflective rain cover to provide all-weather protection for your gear</li> \r\n<li>         20L capacity provides loads of room for an up to 17&#8221; laptop, plus all your essential gaming gear and travel kit</li> \r\n<li>         Padded adjustable shoulder straps, breathable air-mesh back padding, plus a chest strap for absolute comfort</li> \r\n<li>         Built-in USB connector to drive Aura RGB illumination via your own power bank\r\n</li> \r\n</ul></div></div></div></div></div> <div class=\"overviewAwardsContent\"><div class=\"ProductOverviewAwards__productOverviewAwards__CtD9H\"><!----> <!----> <!----></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div id=\"reviews\" class=\"Product__productReviewsWrapper__Q4tw6\" style=\"display:;\"><div class=\"Product__productReviewsTitle__CsKxo\"><h2 class=\"Product__productReviewsTitleText__aEPU6\">CUSTOMER REVIEWS</h2></div> <div class=\"Product__productReviews__QyRI4\"><div data-bv-show=\"reviews\" data-bv-product-id=\"ROG_M1_11043_P\"></div> <div></div></div></div> <div class=\"articleClone\"><!----></div> <div class=\"recommendClone\"><div class=\"ProductRecommendRelated__productRecomm